What does `f(head)` return for the list `4 -> 1 -> 6 -> 2`?
```c
int f(Node *p) {
  if (p == NULL) return 0;
  return p->v + f(p->next);
}
```

What does `h(head)` return for the list `7 -> 3 -> 9 -> 4 -> 4 -> 1`?
```c
int h(Node *p) {
  if (p == NULL || p->next == NULL) return 0;
  return (p->v > p->next->v) + h(p->next);
}
```

